---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Community — Sustainabox">

	<div class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Sustainabox Community</h1>
			<p>Join a network of builders, designers, and entrepreneurs building resilient housing and alternative homes.</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<section class="container content-section">
		<h2>What You Get</h2>

		<div class="benefits">
			<div class="benefit">
				<h3>Expert Office Hours</h3>
				<p>Monthly video calls with Cody. Bring your questions, get feedback, solve problems together.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="benefit">
				<h3>Member-Only Resources</h3>
				<p>Templates, checklists, design guides, cost data, and lessons learned. Everything learned from the Sustainabox build.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="benefit">
				<h3>Private Community Forum</h3>
				<p>Ask questions, share progress, get feedback from peers. 24/7 access to the collective knowledge of everyone building.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="benefit">
				<h3>Exclusive Discounts</h3>
				<p>10% off the cohort-based course. Early access to new products and templates.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="benefit">
				<h3>Design Feedback</h3>
				<p>Share your project. Get constructive feedback from other builders and the instructor. Learn from others' mistakes.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="benefit">
				<h3>Peer Network</h3>
				<p>Connect with builders, designers, engineers, and vendors. Share referrals and recommendations. Build relationships that last.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">How It Works</h2>
		<ol class="process">
			<li><strong>Join as a member.</strong> $30/month or $300/year.</li>
			<li><strong>Get instant access.</strong> Forum, resources, upcoming office hour dates.</li>
			<li><strong>Participate.</strong> Ask questions, share progress, get feedback. Monthly office hours.</li>
			<li><strong>Stay connected.</strong> Keep learning even after your project is done. Help others.</li>
		</ol>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Who's Here</h2>
		<p>First-time container home builders. Architects exploring alternative housing. Construction companies diversifying into resilient design. Engineers and designers. Investors looking at this space. Anyone building or thinking about building differently.</p>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Why Join</h2>
		<div class="why-grid">
			<div class="why-card">
				<strong>Avoid Mistakes</strong>
				<p>Learn from others' experience. Catch issues before they become expensive.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="why-card">
				<strong>Save Time</strong>
				<p>Access real templates and frameworks. Don't reinvent the wheel.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="why-card">
				<strong>Build Relationships</strong>
				<p>Network with peers and professionals in this space. Collaborations happen here.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="why-card">
				<strong>Keep Learning</strong>
				<p>New resources, new members with new experiences. The collective knowledge keeps growing.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="pricing-box">
			<h3>Membership</h3>
			<p><strong>$30/month</strong> or <strong>$300/year</strong> (2 months free if you pay annually)</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Unlimited access to forum and resources</li>
				<li>Monthly expert office hours</li>
				<li>10% discount on course and products</li>
				<li>Early access to new content</li>
				<li>Cancel anytime, no lock-in</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="cta-box">
			<h3>Ready to Join?</h3>
			<p>Jump in and start connecting with builders and makers like you.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Join the Community</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: var(--color-navy);
		color: white;
		padding: 4rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.content-section {
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.content-section h2 {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.benefits {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.benefit {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.benefit h3 {
		color: var(--color-blue);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.benefit p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.process {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.process li {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.why-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.why-card {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.why-card strong {
		color: var(--color-blue);
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.why-card p {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.pricing-box {
		background: var(--color-navy);
		color: white;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.pricing-box h3 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.pricing-box p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.pricing-box ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.pricing-box li {
		padding: 0.5rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.pricing-box li::before {
		content: "✓";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-sky);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.cta-box {
		background: var(--color-blue);
		color: white;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}

	.cta-box h3 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.cta-box p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}
</style>
